{"id":"n49972-2-7","stage":4,"title":"듬뿍 · 足够地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49972-2-7-1","ko":"생일은 잘 보내셨어요?","zh":"生日过得还愉快吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"생일은","meaning":"生日，生辰","explanation":"생일：生日，生辰；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생일","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63220","senseId":"1","lemma":"생일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생일은","audio":"/audio/b9cf7a971c49c9b9f084.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"보내셨어요?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내셨어요","audio":"/audio/f0107ca4a35896c0f2ba.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a2b4cce280c34b80","term":"생일","zh":"生日，生辰","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3","entryId":"63220","definition":"人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생일"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e59ad79a2513843117b5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49972-2-7-2","ko":"네. 축하도 많이 받고 선물도 듬뿍 받아서 참 좋았지요.","zh":"嗯，收到了很多祝福，还收到了好多礼物，非常开心呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId"